sequenceDiagram
  participant O as OPPO媒体
  participant E as OppoRtaService
  participant R as Redis/RTA Worker
  participant W as 微风RTA
  participant C as OPPO点击入口
  participant F as 正式Feedback/Callback
  O->>E: 签名JSON request_id + strategy列表
  E->>E: owner/MD5/时间窗/策略校验
  loop 每个策略仅创建内部请求
    E->>R: relay.accept 创建独立内部oppo状态
  end
  par 后台并发询量
    R->>W: Worker受并发限制执行WEIFENG_RTA
    W-->>R: id/code 决策
  and 响应线程统一等待
    E->>R: 有界轮询各策略状态
  end
  E->>R: 对可返回策略写SYNC_RETURNED
  E-->>O: agree_type_list
  O->>C: code/strategy + request_id + OAID
  C->>R: 校验ALLOW/SYNC_RETURNED/设备hash/有效期
  C->>F: 转为Feedback进入事实 计费 上游点击
  Note over F: 后续上游Callback到达 正式计费/扣量
  F->>O: PASSED后签名POST uploadActiveData
  O-->>F: HTTP2xx且ret=0才记成功
